{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07609","headline":"早发交崖山还太室作 · 崔曙","name":"早发交崖山还太室作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东林气微白，寒鸟急高翔。\n吾亦自兹去，北山归草堂。\n仲冬正三五，日月遥相望。\n萧萧过颍上，曨曨辨少阳。\n川冰生积雪，野火出枯桑。\n独往路难尽，穷阴人易伤。\n伤此无衣客，如何蒙雪霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}